OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain         
OL,6,Fcontinuing for most areas during the   
OL,7,Fevening, perhaps East Lothian and      
OL,8,FBorders seeing some drier spells and   
OL,9,Frain clearing from the east by dawn.   
OL,11,CWednesday:FRain across the southwest   
OL,12,Fat first. Otherwise it will be dry and 
OL,13,Fcloudy, Light winds.                   
OL,15,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry  
OL,16,Fwith bright spells on Thursday but     
OL,17,Fwinds strengthening and rain spreading 
OL,18,Fin later. Wet on Friday, wintry again  
OL,19,Fover hills. Turning brighter but cold  
OL,20,Fagain Friday and Saturday.             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
